{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And goats.</b> Rashi explained: the fleece of goats; therefore Onkelos translated ומעזי וכו׳. Consequently the translator who renders ומעזי is mistaken."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "Chizkuni cites Rashi by name here, an exception to his usual practice of not naming sources; the name is preserved as he wrote it. The final clause ('the translator who renders ומעזי') likely refers to a translator other than Onkelos whose rendering Chizkuni rejects."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:16.795420619Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}